"desc":"说明后果或承载简短表单，控制内容长度","desc_en":"Explain consequences or host short forms to control content length"},{"key":"footer","cn":"操作区","en":"Footer","desc":"主按钮说清结果，危险动作同时用文字和视觉提示风险","desc_en":"The main button explains the results clearly, and dangerous actions use text and visual reminders of risks."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"确认对话框","en":"Confirm","demo":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:72%\"></i><i style=\"width:88%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">确认删除？</div><div class=\"dm-line\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">确认删除</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:72%\"></i><i style=\"width:88%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">Confirm deletion? </div><div class=\"dm-line\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Confirm deletion</span></div></div></div>","when":"危险操作需要用户明确确认后才能继续","when_en":"Dangerous operations require explicit confirmation from the user before continuing."},{"cn":"表单弹窗","en":"Form","demo":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:80%\"></i><i style=\"width:64%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">重命名项目</div><div class=\"modal-field\">官网改版 v2</div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:80%\"></i><i style=\"width:64%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">Rename project</div><div class=\"modal-field\">Website refresh v2</div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save</span></div></div></div>","when":"就地完成重命名、新建等短表单","when_en":"Complete short forms such as renaming and creating new ones on the spot"},{"cn":"内容预览","en":"Preview","demo":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:76%\"></i><i style=\"width:84%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">封面预览</div><div class=\"dm-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:22px\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">关闭</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:76%\"></i><i style=\"width:84%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">Cover preview</div><div class=\"dm-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:22px\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Close</span></div></div></div>","when":"放大看图片或详情，看完就关掉","when_en":"Zoom in to see pictures or details, then close when finished"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>危险操作二次确认</b>：删除、清空、解散","m":"modal-confirm"},{"t":"<b>就地填写短表单</b>：例如重命名或新建","m":"modal-rename"},{"t":"<b>放大看内容</b>：图片预览、详情速览","m":"modal-detail"},{"t":"<b>需要处理才能继续</b>：实名认证、协议签署","m":"modal-block"}],"dont":[{"t":"内容需要长时间滚动：使用 {c:drawer} 或新页面","m":"modal-tall","bad":true},{"t":"在弹窗上继续叠加弹窗：用户难以理解当前层级","m":"modal-nested","bad":true},{"t":"只需反馈操作成功：使用 {c:toast}","m":"modal-as-toast","bad":true},{"t":"用弹窗展示营销内容：容易干扰当前任务并被关闭","m":"modal-ad","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"用户要修改账单地址，完成后还要回到订单原位置。怎样安排这段编辑？","options":[{"id":"contained-task","label":"打开居中的编辑弹窗，保存或取消后回到订单原位置","feedback":"对。独立、短暂且需要专注的任务适合弹窗；内容很长或多步时应进入完整页面。","correct":true},{"id":"every-tip","label":"在页面顶部展开地址表单，保存后再让用户滚回订单","feedback":"内联编辑并非不能用，但把表单插到页面顶部会打断当前位置；这项短任务更适合在原页面上方集中完成。","correct":false},{"id":"navigation","label":"进入独立的地址管理页，保存后再重新找到这张订单","feedback":"独立页面适合更长、更复杂的地址管理；这里只修改当前订单地址，跳走会增加返回和重新定位成本。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Editing a billing address has several fields but should not leave the order page. When does a Modal fit?","options":[{"id":"contained-task","label":"Use a Modal for this short, focused edit with clear save and close","feedback":"Correct. A separate, brief task needing focus fits a modal; long or multi-step work belongs on a full page.","correct":true},{"id":"every-tip","label":"Put every explanatory line in a Modal so it is always seen","feedback":"Frequent interruption adds burden; simple guidance does not need a modal layer.","correct":false},{"id":"navigation","label":"Put primary site navigation in a Modal","feedback":"Navigation should remain predictable and returnable, not trap site paths in a dialog.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"订单页的地址编辑请放进 Modal，打开后焦点进入标题或首个字段，提供保存和关闭；关闭后焦点回到触发按钮。保存一次和按 Esc 关闭一次，确认订单页背景未被误操作且焦点返回正确位置。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Put order-page address editing in a Modal. On open, move focus to its title or first field; provide Save and Close, then return focus to the trigger on close. Test saving once and closing with Esc once, confirming background actions cannot fire and focus returns correctly."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:72%\"></i><i style=\"width:88%\"></i><i style=\"width:56%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">确认删除这个项目？</div><div class=\"dm-line\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">确认删除</span></div></div></div><div class=\"demo-live-trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-open-modal>打开交互示例</button><span class=\"hint\">上方为静态示意，点击按钮可查看交互效果</span></div>","references":[{"title":"对话框（模态）模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/dialog-modal/","title_en":"Dialog (Modal) Pattern"}],"scenes":["删除确认","重命名弹窗","图片预览","强制实名认证"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:72%\"></i><i style=\"width:88%\"></i><i style=\"